<title>USA: Shaw sees lower earnings than projected.</title>
<headline>Shaw sees lower earnings than projected.</headline>
<dateline>DALTON, Ga. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shaw Industries Inc said on Thursday it expects to record third quarter earnings of about $0.18 per share, below analysts' estimates of $0.20 per share.</p>
<p>In the same period a year ago, the company recorded earnings of $0.16 per share.</p>
<p>Shaw said it expects to report sales for the third quarter ended September 28 of about $880 million, about 4.5 percent less than expected.</p>
<p>The company plans to release results on October 22.</p>
</text>
